    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join The Gang!</h1><p><strong>WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW: </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/b3f0f1572be3ddee1ca5d4134137b901.poster.avif?t=1728123559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/b3f0f1572be3ddee1ca5d4134137b901.webm?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/b3f0f1572be3ddee1ca5d4134137b901.mp4?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>DISCORD CHANNEL: </strong><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>PUSHER - DRUG TYCOON</strong> is thrilling business tycoon sim where you step into the shoes of a drug dealer in 1980s USA.<br><br>Enter the world of <strong>drug trafficking</strong> armed with your <strong>pager and gun</strong>, where strategy is the key to making <strong>great profits.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your main goal is simple: </h2><br><br><strong>BUY LOW</strong> and <strong>SELL HIGH.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/336ce97bea17b484495d8aefd6438f5b.poster.avif?t=1728123559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/336ce97bea17b484495d8aefd6438f5b.webm?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/336ce97bea17b484495d8aefd6438f5b.mp4?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Seek the <strong>Right Time</strong> and <strong>Right Price</strong>.<br><br>Keep a keen eye on <strong>market fluctuations</strong> and <strong>random events</strong> to <strong>make calculated decisions</strong> that will <strong>maximize your profits</strong>. Expand your trade to <strong>major cities across the United States.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/a883d5bee57c7368ec08e63cf6afcb23.poster.avif?t=1728123559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/a883d5bee57c7368ec08e63cf6afcb23.webm?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/a883d5bee57c7368ec08e63cf6afcb23.mp4?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Beware of <strong>rival dealers and gangs</strong> competing for their share of the market.<br><br>The law is keeping a close eye on your every move and won't hesitate to take action against you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/7599663317dc47cb64a048b5c8163c4c.poster.avif?t=1728123559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/7599663317dc47cb64a048b5c8163c4c.webm?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/7599663317dc47cb64a048b5c8163c4c.mp4?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Step up your game by investing in <strong>properties, facilities, and assembling a top-notch team</strong>. Show everyone who's the boss while <strong>earning even more cash.</strong><br><br><strong>Are you ready to become the biggest and most feared kingpin in New York?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Trade and Profit:</strong> <i>Buy and sell drugs at the right time and price. Keep a keen eye on market fluctuations and trends to make strategic decisions.</i><br></li><li><strong>Check the Pager:</strong> <i>Catch the best deals coming your way.</i><br></li><li><strong>Turn based Fights:</strong> <i>Evaluate the risks and decide whether to fight, negotiate for a peaceful solution, or try to escape.</i><br></li><li><strong>Money Laundering:</strong> <i>You'll deal with cash for your drug transactions but invest in legal assets using the money you've cleaned.</i><br></li><li><strong>Bulid you team:</strong> <i>Recruit street-smart individuals to help you making money on the streets and legal experts who keep you one step ahead of the authorities.</i><br></li><li><strong>Explore Major US Cities:</strong> <i>Seek opportunities to sell and buy drugs from coast to coast.</i><br></li><li><strong>Confront the Law:</strong> <i>The law is keeping a close eye on your every move and won't hesitate to take action against you.</i><br></li><li><strong>Spend your money:</strong> <i>Buy properties, guns, cars, and pawn shop finds to boost your stats.</i><br></li><li><strong>Random events:</strong> <i>Get ready for unexpected events that can either help or hurt your business - depending on how you handle them.</i><br></li><li><strong>Endless replayability:</strong> <i>Experience satisfying gameplay sessions minutes to hours, tailored to your time and mood. Each playthrough is unique, keeping you engaged for hours on end.</i></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>PUSHER - DRUG TYCOON</strong> is thrilling business tycoon sim where you step into the shoes of a drug dealer in 1980s USA.<br><br>Enter the world of <strong>drug trafficking</strong> armed with your <strong>pager and gun</strong>, where strategy is the key to making <strong>great profits.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your main goal is simple: </h2><br><br><strong>BUY LOW</strong> and <strong>SELL HIGH.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/336ce97bea17b484495d8aefd6438f5b.poster.avif?t=1728123559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/336ce97bea17b484495d8aefd6438f5b.webm?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/336ce97bea17b484495d8aefd6438f5b.mp4?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Seek the <strong>Right Time</strong> and <strong>Right Price</strong>.<br><br>Keep a keen eye on <strong>market fluctuations</strong> and <strong>random events</strong> to <strong>make calculated decisions</strong> that will <strong>maximize your profits</strong>. Expand your trade to <strong>major cities across the United States.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/a883d5bee57c7368ec08e63cf6afcb23.poster.avif?t=1728123559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/a883d5bee57c7368ec08e63cf6afcb23.webm?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497210/extras/a883d5bee57c7368ec08e63cf6afcb23.mp4?t=1728123559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video