opportunities to sell and buy drugs from coast to coast.</i><br></li><li><strong>Confront the Law:</strong> <i>The law is keeping a close eye on your every move and won't hesitate to take action against you.</i><br></li><li><strong>Spend your money:</strong> <i>Buy properties, guns, cars, and pawn shop finds to boost your stats.</i><br></li><li><strong>Random events:</strong> <i>Get ready for unexpected events that can either help or hurt your business - depending on how you handle them.</i><br></li><li><strong>Endless replayability:</strong> <i>Experience satisfying gameplay sessions minutes to hours, tailored to your time and mood. Each playthrough is unique, keeping you engaged for hours on end.</i></li></ul>",
